==Description==
The '''Spooky Crate''' is an exclusive crate that was only obtainable during the [[Halloween 2020 Event]] from the [[Halloween 2020 Event#Halloween Season Pass|Halloween Season]] at Rank 4, 6, 9, 11, 12 and 13. Rank 4 and 6 would give you one '''Spooky Crate''', Rank 9 and 11 would give you two, Rank 12 would give you three and Rank 13 would give you four.

This crate provides special Halloween-themed skins. One of the skins could have been earned previously with the [[Halloween 2019 Crate]].

The appearance of the '''Spooky Crate''' is similar to the [[Pumpkin Crate]]. It is a large black and dark navy chest with a pumpkin emblem on the front. It also has orange bat wings. There are large golden spikes along the top of the chest. It is opened by a crowbar.

