*You cannot get the [[Crook Boss|{{Color|Halloween2019|Demon}} Crook Boss]]/[[Golden Crook Boss|{{Color|Halloween2019|Demon}} Golden Crook Boss]] if you have already obtained the skin from the [[Halloween 2019 Crate]].

